1
00:00:08,919 --> 00:00:09,679
My name is Ruan Che.

2
00:00:10,359 --> 00:00:11,480
You can call me Che.

3
00:00:14,279 --> 00:00:15,000
New character.

4
00:00:16,559 --> 00:00:17,120
Che.

5
00:00:19,719 --> 00:00:20,399
Che, be good.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:21,879
Where is Gu Jiachen?

7
00:00:22,679 --> 00:00:23,719
Gu Jiachen.

8
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:25,760
The three of them

9
00:00:25,879 --> 00:00:26,920
are sleeping here now.

10
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:29,239
Don't wake them up.

11
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:31,160
I want

12
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:32,600
to spend some time alone with you.

13
00:00:33,679 --> 00:00:34,119
[Oh, no.]

14
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:36,240
[I got a hidden figure in the blind box.]

15
00:00:36,759 --> 00:00:38,039
I need to call Gu Jiachen back.

16
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:00,600
It doesn't work.

17
00:01:02,119 --> 00:01:03,359
Because I'm special.

18
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:04,719
Unless I volunteer,

19
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:06,359
even your kiss

20
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:07,599
can't drive me away.

21
00:01:10,519 --> 00:01:12,480
Do you hate me so much?

22
00:01:13,959 --> 00:01:15,439
We finally met.

23
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:16,920
No, no, no.

24
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:18,640
I'm not trying to drive you away.

25
00:01:21,519 --> 00:01:23,680
Now there are bad guys trying to sabotage.

26
00:01:24,439 --> 00:01:25,519
If Gu Jiachen is not here,

27
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:27,159
we will all be in danger.

28
00:01:30,599 --> 00:01:31,159
How about this?

29
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:33,599
If you promise me one thing,

30
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:35,359
I'll let Gu Jiachen come back.

31
00:01:36,359 --> 00:01:36,920
What is it?

32
00:01:38,799 --> 00:01:39,359
You go...

33
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:42,719
No way.

34
00:01:43,439 --> 00:01:44,200
Absolutely no way.

35
00:01:44,879 --> 00:01:45,599
This is too shameful.

36
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:49,599
Painting God,

37
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,840
how could I have agreed to this?

38
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:00,040
Don't peek, okay?

39
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:05,280
It's just one game of hide and seek.

40
00:02:05,959 --> 00:02:06,480
Ten seconds.

41
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:07,799
Not even one second more.

42
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:08,759
Okay.

43
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:10,319
One,

44
00:02:11,039 --> 00:02:11,439
two,

45
00:02:12,319 --> 00:02:12,719
three,

46
00:02:13,439 --> 00:02:13,879
four,

47
00:02:14,759 --> 00:02:15,280
five,

48
00:02:15,879 --> 00:02:16,240
six,

49
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:17,520
seven,

50
00:02:18,319 --> 00:02:18,800
eight,

51
00:02:19,479 --> 00:02:20,000
nine,

52
00:02:20,719 --> 00:02:21,039
ten.

53
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:31,240
This kid

54
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:32,719
hid pretty quickly.

55
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:33,199
Noble Consort Xiao,

56
00:03:33,879 --> 00:03:34,479
it's late,

57
00:03:35,159 --> 00:03:36,000
His Highness has gone to bed.

58
00:03:36,439 --> 00:03:37,080
He can't see you.

59
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:37,960
He's in bed?

60
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:41,240
I heard that His Highness is not feeling well,

61
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,080
so I come to visit him.

62
00:03:42,719 --> 00:03:43,360
Commander Shen,

63
00:03:44,319 --> 00:03:44,800
what?

64
00:03:45,159 --> 00:03:46,479
You even want to stop me

65
00:03:46,479 --> 00:03:47,120
from doing a good deed?

66
00:03:47,639 --> 00:03:48,719
His Highness needs to rest.

67
00:03:49,159 --> 00:03:50,159
No one is allowed to disturb him.

68
00:03:51,039 --> 00:03:51,879
Please go back, Your Highness.

69
00:03:53,439 --> 00:03:55,240
Then does His Highness like

70
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:57,039
the gift I sent?

71
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:58,879
So it was you who did it on purpose.

72
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:00,560
What?

73
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:01,439
Are you angry?

74
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,159
I just want to see

75
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,319
the look of your

76
00:04:04,439 --> 00:04:05,840
split soul.

77
00:04:06,479 --> 00:04:07,919
It's not too much to ask.

78
00:04:07,919 --> 00:04:08,639
Noble Consort Xiao.

79
00:04:10,719 --> 00:04:11,439
Shen Li.

80
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:13,879
For so many years,

81
00:04:14,599 --> 00:04:15,960
your master has been

82
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:17,879
a well-behaved dog in front of me.

83
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:18,879
What?

84
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,639
You're not used to it?

85
00:04:21,839 --> 00:04:22,439
Move aside.

86
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:23,319
Don't even think about it.

87
00:04:40,199 --> 00:04:41,240
Your Highness.

88
00:04:41,519 --> 00:04:42,839
If you don't respond,

89
00:04:43,079 --> 00:04:44,560
I'll just go in myself.

90
00:04:47,399 --> 00:04:48,160
Your Highness,

91
00:04:48,879 --> 00:04:49,839
are you satisfied

92
00:04:50,199 --> 00:04:51,199
with that jade belt?

93
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,480
I thought

94
00:04:53,079 --> 00:04:53,879
that thing

95
00:04:54,399 --> 00:04:55,519
is best at awakening

96
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,560
the God of Death within you.

97
00:04:58,079 --> 00:04:59,240
Isn't that soul-splitting feeling,

98
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:00,879
the sense of being out of control,

99
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:03,279
Isn't it interesting?

100
00:05:16,279 --> 00:05:16,959
Your Highness,

101
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,360
what are you expecting to see

102
00:05:20,199 --> 00:05:21,480
in my bath palace at midnight?

103
00:05:22,399 --> 00:05:23,959
You seem

104
00:05:24,519 --> 00:05:25,399
to be fine.

105
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,439
You've seen it

106
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:31,199
with your own eyes

107
00:05:31,199 --> 00:05:32,040
whether I'm fine or not.

108
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:34,240
I've received

109
00:05:34,839 --> 00:05:35,560
your gift.

110
00:05:35,959 --> 00:05:36,560
But

111
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,600
it's just a jade belt.

112
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:41,199
What reaction

113
00:05:41,199 --> 00:05:42,560
were you expecting from me?

114
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:44,199
You're in such a good mood.

115
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:46,319
Now that you're finally proud,

116
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:47,839
you indulge in pleasures.

117
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:49,720
But don't forget,

118
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:51,720
you've been humble

119
00:05:52,199 --> 00:05:53,879
before me for years.

120
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:55,879
That's because only I

121
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,560
am willing to accept your secret.

122
00:05:58,600 --> 00:05:59,199
If the woman

123
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,399
in your arms

124
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,600
knew you were a monster

125
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:05,199
with four souls in one body,

126
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:07,560
would she still stay by your side?

127
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:13,360
Why wouldn't she?

128
00:06:17,319 --> 00:06:18,160
Your Highness,

129
00:06:18,959 --> 00:06:19,720
after today,

130
00:06:20,399 --> 00:06:21,439
will you still remember me?

131
00:06:22,319 --> 00:06:23,240
It's you!

132
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,279
Thank you for

133
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:27,639
the gold ingots you sent today.

134
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:28,959
Are you satisfied

135
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,040
with the money

136
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,000
I tricked from you?

137
00:06:31,639 --> 00:06:32,720
Your Highness is so generous,

138
00:06:33,319 --> 00:06:35,079
far more generous than His Highness.

139
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:37,600
I was greedy for a moment.

140
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:40,240
Now that Your Highness knows everything,

141
00:06:40,399 --> 00:06:41,279
there's no need to hide it.

142
00:06:41,759 --> 00:06:43,199
What do you want to see

143
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:45,240
now?

144
00:06:46,839 --> 00:06:48,480
You want to see

145
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:50,000
our night together.

146
00:06:51,279 --> 00:06:52,079
Fine.

147
00:06:53,279 --> 00:06:54,040
Very fine.

148
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:05,800
Gu Jiachen, you've got it back.

149
00:07:05,839 --> 00:07:06,839
Why do you still kiss me?

150
00:07:08,839 --> 00:07:09,879
Your Highness.

151
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,480
If you don't answer,

152
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:13,240
I'll go in myself.

153
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:17,079
[Xiao Yunshang is really here.]

154
00:07:33,639 --> 00:07:34,399
Thank you for being with me.

155
00:07:36,399 --> 00:07:37,000
I know

156
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:38,720
you're just trying to

157
00:07:39,319 --> 00:07:40,839
bring Gu Jiachen back.

158
00:07:42,399 --> 00:07:43,519
Though it was brief,

159
00:07:45,519 --> 00:07:46,480
I'm content.

160
00:07:50,959 --> 00:07:51,519
Now,

161
00:07:52,279 --> 00:07:53,639
I'll let you have her back.

162
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:56,680
Kiss me.

163
00:08:31,439 --> 00:08:32,559
Chen loves you so much.

164
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:35,919
I hope you're happy.

165
00:08:44,039 --> 00:08:44,480
Sister,

166
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:48,639
we'll meet again soon.

167
00:08:51,039 --> 00:08:51,759
Sister?

168
00:08:54,879 --> 00:08:55,679
Six years ago,

169
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,879
he was the only one who called me that.

170
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:03,440
[Just now,]

171
00:09:03,679 --> 00:09:05,159
[I'm sorry for you.]

172
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:06,679
Ms. Feng,

173
00:09:06,799 --> 00:09:07,919
you'd better get up and change your clothes.

174
00:09:08,039 --> 00:09:08,840
The water in the pool is cold.

175
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:09,799
Don't catch a cold.

176
00:09:10,559 --> 00:09:12,799
I'll be punished after this.

177
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:15,039
Silly boy.

178
00:09:16,159 --> 00:09:16,639
What?

179
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,200
If I really minded,

180
00:09:19,639 --> 00:09:20,559
why would I cooperate with you?

181
00:09:22,879 --> 00:09:23,840
I'm just angry.

182
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,120
We are partners now.

183
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:27,279
We are friends to some extent.

184
00:09:27,879 --> 00:09:29,080
Why didn't you tell me

185
00:09:29,639 --> 00:09:30,759
that you were manipulated by her?

186
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,240
We could have been on the same side.

187
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,320
Well.

188
00:09:37,159 --> 00:09:38,440
I've been controlling him for years.

189
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:39,840
How dare he

190
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,000
sing against me

191
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:41,960
in front of me?

192
00:09:42,639 --> 00:09:43,279
Your Highness.

193
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:44,679
Could it be that

194
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:46,200
he has mastered

195
00:09:46,519 --> 00:09:47,799
the way to control the soul?

196
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:50,399
Yes or no,

197
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,320
he can't escape

198
00:09:52,399 --> 00:09:53,840
from my control.

199
00:09:58,639 --> 00:09:59,360
You said

200
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:00,759
his name is Ruan Che?

201
00:10:02,919 --> 00:10:03,759
You don't know him?

202
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:06,519
I do.

203
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:08,679
There are several different souls

204
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,159
living in my body.

205
00:10:10,919 --> 00:10:11,679
Fu Yi.

206
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:12,600
Ye Xuan.

207
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:15,159
But I really don't have any impression

208
00:10:17,559 --> 00:10:18,960
of this Ruan Che,

209
00:10:19,399 --> 00:10:20,519
nor do I remember this name.

210
00:10:21,799 --> 00:10:22,639
What did he do to you?

211
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:23,879
Nothing.

212
00:10:24,639 --> 00:10:25,360
He just

213
00:10:25,399 --> 00:10:26,600
made me play hide and seek with him.

214
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,080
Peekaboo?

215
00:10:29,799 --> 00:10:31,360
Yuan Che said that was his condition.

216
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,240
What could I do?

217
00:10:35,519 --> 00:10:35,919
By the way,

218
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,480
he called me sister.

219
00:10:38,759 --> 00:10:39,799
Sister?

220
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:40,360
Gu Jiachen,

221
00:10:40,799 --> 00:10:42,360
did you have a

222
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:43,480
dear sister before?

223
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:49,240
I don't remember.

224
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:51,919
Six years ago,

225
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,559
I was seriously ill.

226
00:10:54,799 --> 00:10:55,679
Since then,

227
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:57,600
I've been like this.

228
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,720
The illness took away

229
00:11:00,279 --> 00:11:01,679
far more than I imagined.

230
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:03,559
Many memories

231
00:11:04,399 --> 00:11:05,399
are fragmented.

232
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:07,679
Many people and events

233
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:09,600
are shrouded in a mist.

234
00:11:11,159 --> 00:11:12,200
I can't recall them clearly.

235
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:15,639
What about those wounds on you?

236
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:19,879
Yexuan is a fighter.

237
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:21,759
They are just old wounds.

238
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:25,399
Gu Jiachen.

239
00:11:26,399 --> 00:11:28,080
Haven't you ever thought about

240
00:11:28,799 --> 00:11:30,159
finding your previous memories?

241
00:11:33,679 --> 00:11:34,279
I have.

242
00:11:36,039 --> 00:11:36,879
And I haven't.

243
00:11:37,759 --> 00:11:38,679
Why?

244
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:42,240
If he's someone important,

245
00:11:43,279 --> 00:11:44,000
I'd make him sad

246
00:11:44,919 --> 00:11:45,759
if I forget him.

247
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,320
I'd rather he forgets me.

248
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:52,000
What if

249
00:11:52,799 --> 00:11:54,200
he never forgot you?

250
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:00,200
Then he's

251
00:12:03,519 --> 00:12:04,039
a fool.

252
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:10,519
There may be

253
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:11,759
Xiao Yunshang's men outside.

254
00:12:12,639 --> 00:12:13,440
Now that she knows

255
00:12:13,519 --> 00:12:14,399
we're on the same side,

256
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:15,639
I'll send

257
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:17,240
to protect you.

258
00:12:18,080 --> 00:12:18,600
Tonight,

259
00:12:19,679 --> 00:12:21,440
you can stay in the palace.

260
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:23,080
I'll go to the side hall.

261
00:12:25,679 --> 00:12:27,039
If you're worried about my safety,

262
00:12:27,159 --> 00:12:27,960
why leave me

263
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:28,639
alone here?

264
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:31,279
Then...

265
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,759
Then I'll sleep on the...

266
00:12:34,759 --> 00:12:35,519
Don't even think about the floor.

267
00:12:35,799 --> 00:12:37,279
You're the Crown Prince, and I'm just a servant.

268
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:38,759
If you sleep on the floor,

269
00:12:38,919 --> 00:12:39,799
Shen Li will see it tomorrow

270
00:12:39,799 --> 00:12:41,279
and kill me with his eyes.

271
00:12:43,879 --> 00:12:45,799
What do you mean?

272
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:48,000
There's a big bed.

273
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:49,039
Just put a pillow.

274
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,240
It's fine as long as we don't cross the line.

275
00:13:00,519 --> 00:13:00,960
Okay.

276
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:02,360
I'm just kidding.

277
00:13:02,799 --> 00:13:04,519
You really stay here.

278
00:13:27,440 --> 00:13:27,799
Alright.

279
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:29,320
Now that we've made a deal,

280
00:13:29,559 --> 00:13:30,799
we'll stay out of each other's way.

281
00:13:32,399 --> 00:13:33,480
Lady Feng,

282
00:13:33,879 --> 00:13:34,960
you seem to be worried about me.

283
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:37,759
I'm actually worried about

284
00:13:37,799 --> 00:13:38,480
myself.

285
00:13:38,919 --> 00:13:40,759
After all, you're so handsome.

286
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:42,879
I'm afraid I can't help but...

287
00:13:54,519 --> 00:13:55,320
Go to bed.

288
00:13:55,440 --> 00:13:56,519
I have to get up early to write tomorrow.

289
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:04,639
Gu Jiachen,

290
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:09,279
did Xiao Yunshang

291
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:10,840
threaten you with your secret

292
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:12,360
to make you do

293
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:13,360
something you don't want to do?

294
00:14:19,039 --> 00:14:19,600
Your Majesty,

295
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:21,399
the evidence of

296
00:14:21,440 --> 00:14:23,080
Lord Wang's treason is conclusive.

297
00:14:23,399 --> 00:14:24,440
He deserves to be killed.

298
00:14:24,720 --> 00:14:25,799
What are you hesitating about?

299
00:14:29,639 --> 00:14:32,080
Mr. Wang is a veteran of our dynasty.

300
00:14:33,360 --> 00:14:34,519
This matter has not been fully investigated.

301
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:36,200
How about...

302
00:14:36,360 --> 00:14:37,240
Investigate?

303
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:39,759
If I say it's investigated,

304
00:14:39,799 --> 00:14:41,039
then it's investigated.

305
00:14:41,240 --> 00:14:41,759
What?

306
00:14:42,639 --> 00:14:44,399
Do you want to disobey my order?

307
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:46,320
Or

308
00:14:46,919 --> 00:14:49,639
do you want me to reveal

309
00:14:49,679 --> 00:14:51,080
your little secrets

310
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:54,360
in the court?

311
00:14:57,279 --> 00:14:57,720
Draft the decree.

312
00:14:58,840 --> 00:14:59,399
Yes.

313
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:02,679
This woman is too bad.

314
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:04,120
Because of this person,

315
00:15:05,159 --> 00:15:07,120
I have been unable to sleep for years.

316
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:09,879
The royal physician said this was a mental illness.

317
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:12,000
Medicines are ineffective.

318
00:15:18,240 --> 00:15:20,240
I used to be often sleepless

319
00:15:20,240 --> 00:15:21,000
because of bad reviews.

320
00:15:21,919 --> 00:15:23,639
But now I think it's okay.

321
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:25,120
As a person,

322
00:15:25,679 --> 00:15:26,559
why do you care so much

323
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:27,320
about other people's opinions?

324
00:15:27,799 --> 00:15:28,279
You say it.

325
00:15:37,919 --> 00:15:39,600
You are too relieved about me.

326
00:15:44,039 --> 00:15:44,720
Sister

327
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:48,240
[Ten days later,]

328
00:15:49,399 --> 00:15:51,000
[west of Qing Bridge.]

329
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:21,320
Gu Jiachen,

330
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:23,799
you were talking in your sleep last night.

331
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:25,399
Something about Qingqiao.

332
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:26,720
Could it be that you...
